@prefix ex: <urn:airgap:kg:> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
ex:Observation a owl:Class .
ex:Asset a owl:Class .
ex:Source a owl:Class .
ex:asset a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Observation ; rdfs:range ex:Asset .
ex:source a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Observation ; rdfs:range ex:Source .
ex:property a owl:DatatypeProperty .
ex:value a owl:DatatypeProperty .
ex:classification a owl:ObjectProperty .
ex:observedAt a owl:DatatypeProperty .
